=== PRIMARY metric note ===
mean daily CS RankIC = average over dates of Spearman(pred, y) within that day's cross-section
pooled Spearman stacks all (date,asset) rows — confounds TS persistence with CS ranking

=== oracle upper bound (beta_true as score) ===
oracle_beta_true             mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0991 t=6.29 ICIR=3.71 n_days=726  | pooled_Spearman=+0.0837 (counterexample)

=== LEAK demos (inflated) vs CLEAN purged ===
LEAK shuffle_split           mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0345 t=2.82 ICIR=1.68 n_days=708  | pooled_Spearman=+0.0615 (counterexample)
LEAK unpurged_KFold          mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0518 t=6.03 ICIR=3.55 n_days=726  | pooled_Spearman=+0.0654 (counterexample)
CLEAN purged_ridge           mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0398 t=4.64 ICIR=2.73 n_days=726  | pooled_Spearman=-0.0076 (counterexample)
CLEAN purged_GBM(lightgbm)   mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0336 t=4.69 ICIR=2.77 n_days=726  | pooled_Spearman=+0.0105 (counterexample)

=== OVERFIT trap (deep GBM + 40 noise features) ===
overfit_GBM train            mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.3445 t=41.67 ICIR=29.35 n_days=508  | pooled_Spearman=+0.4001 (counterexample)
overfit_GBM OOS              mean_daily_CS_RankIC=+0.0211 t=1.73 ICIR=1.86 n_days=218  | pooled_Spearman=+0.0098 (counterexample)

