teach three cases:
  (a) ILLUSION: leak protocols inflate IC (unpurged/shuffle) without a real OOS edge
  (b) WEAK RECOVERABLE: purged ridge/GBM still recover mean CS IC ~ +0.04 on this planted weak panel
  (c) REAL BUT COST-WIPED: see lab 02 — positive IC can still yield net SR≤0 after shared costs
verify: purged_ridge mean daily CS IC = 0.0398 (reviewer ~+0.040)
